{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52923","headline":"刺当涂者 · 王志安","name":"刺当涂者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"末刼兰香科下人，衣冠礼乐与君臣。\n如来若向阎浮出，莫现从来丈六身。\n（同前）（按：《封氏闻见记》云：「补阙王志安晚不得志，久游恒、赵之间，人畏其口，莫敢引用。\n志安作诗以刺当涂者云〖略〗。\n见者弥增怨忌。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王志安","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}